    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d635">

                <pb facs="0610" n="1344" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1344"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr. Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-11-19"><hi rendition="#italic">November 19,
                        1895</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Missionaries at Bitlis telegraph for escort for all to Van, and those at Harpoot
                    wish to come here. Telegraphic orders to furnish safe escort demanded and sent
                    for all. If you can spare another, send a vessel to Smyrna, to go thence
                    wherever needed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
